    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Mega Man - The Hedgehog Trap is a romhack of Mega Man 3 and mostly takes place in custom-made 8-bit versions of levels from the Sonic the Hedgehog series. The hack contains alterations to the graphics, level design, sound effects, storyline, most weapons and all boss AI of the original game. There are two .avi cutscenes that are not available in this release."
    }
